        <mxCell id="note1" value="Template Method (06): generateReport() fixes the skeleton collectData → processData → formatReport; the concrete report overrides only the steps. EnrollmentStatisticsReport and CoursePopularityReport follow this same sequence with different data sources. Data access is read-only via service APIs (§4.3)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#B09500;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
